{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17333","headline":"杂言同用离骚体送张评事襄阳觐省 · 权德舆","name":"杂言同用离骚体送张评事襄阳觐省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黯离堂兮日晚，俨壶觞兮送远。\n远水霁兮微明，杜蘅秀兮白芷生。\n波泫泫兮烟幂幂，凝暮色於空碧。\n纷离念兮随君，泝九江兮经七泽。\n君之去兮不可留，五采裳兮木兰舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}